==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} ''[[horrificus]]''; ''[[horrere]]'' to be horrible + ''[[-ficare]]'' (in comp.) to make: confer {{etyl|fr}} ''[[horrifique]]''.  See [[horror]], [[-fy]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪfɪk}}

===Adjective===
'''horrific'''

# [[horrifying]], causing [[horror]]; [[horrible]].

